@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@email = owner@example.test
@password = <set-local-test-password>
@csrf = <copy-token-from-csrf-response>
@access = <copy-access-token-from-login-response>
@userId = <copy-user-id-from-registration-response>
@confirmation = <copy-token-from-mailpit-confirmation-link>
@jobId = <copy-job-id>
@templateId = <copy-template-id>
@rowVersion = <copy-base64-row-version>

### Keep the cookie jar enabled. Fetch CSRF again after changing bearer identity.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### Register: server determines organization, role and active/confirmed flags
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Test Owner","organizationName":"Test Organization","email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Confirm email (POST; token is never put in the API URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/confirm-email
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","token":"{{confirmation}}"}

### Login: refresh token is returned only as an HttpOnly cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Get CSRF for authenticated requests and copy the new token to @csrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Current profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Create job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/job-positions
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Backend Engineer","description":"Build reliable APIs","seniority":"Senior","status":"Draft"}

### Create template
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interview-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"jobPositionId":"{{jobId}}","title":"Technical interview","language":"fa-IR","durationMinutes":30,"maxFollowUpQuestionsPerQuestion":2,"questions":[{"text":"Explain a technical decision","order":1,"competency":"Judgement","evaluationGuidance":"Look for evidence and trade-offs"}]}

### Archive job with its current rowVersion
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/job-positions/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"job":{"title":"Backend Engineer","description":"Build reliable APIs","seniority":"Senior","status":"Archived"},"rowVersion":"{{rowVersion}}"}

### Invite recruiter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/members/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"recruiter@example.test"}

### Refresh: same bearer identity as the CSRF fetch; after access expires fetch anonymous CSRF and omit Authorization from both
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Logout all
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Forgot password: generic response does not assert delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}
